"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"10\" width=\"14\" height=\"11\"></rect><path d=\"M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3m-4 4v3\"></path></svg></span><div><b>Personal plans</b><small>Not selected · Not synced</small></div><span class=\"s212-tick\">—</span></div></div><figcaption>Only selected business conversations enter your team workspace.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"security-row section-reveal-item\" style=\"--reveal-delay: 180ms;\"><article data-box-entrance=\"left\" class=\"\" data-palette331=\"0\"><h3 style=\"\"><span class=\"s212-feature-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"7\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\"></rect><path d=\"M8 7V3h8v4M3 12h18m-11 0v3h4v-3\"></path></svg></span>Business chats you pick</h3><p style=\"\">Choose the business conversations to sync.</p></article><article data-box-entrance=\"bottom\" class=\"\" data-palette331=\"1\"><h3 style=\"\"><span class=\"s212-feature-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"10\" width=\"14\" height=\"11\"></rect><path d=\"M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3m-4 4v3\"></path></svg></span>Private conversations</h3><p style=\"\">Only selected business chats are synced.</p></article><article data-box-entrance=\"right\" class=\"\" data-palette331=\"2\"><h3 style=\"\"><span class=\"s212-feature-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 2 8 3v6c0 5-8 11-8 11S4 16 4 11V5l8-3Z\"></path><path d=\"m8 11 3 3 5-6\"></path></svg></span>Access controls</h3><p style=\"\">Keep business conversations under your access controls.</p></article></div></section><section id=\"faq\" class=\"restored-extra wrap section-reveal-group f212 page-frame343 page-section343\" style=\"background-position: 0% 0% !important; background-size: auto !important; background-repeat: repeat !important; background-origin: padding-box !important; background-clip: border-box !important; background-attachment: scroll !important;\"><div class=\"f212-heading\" data-box-entrance=\"left\"><div class=\"section-tag section-reveal-item\" style=\"--reveal-delay: 0ms;\">Frequently Asked Questions</div><h2>Know What Connects</h2><p>Your questions about conversations, calls and access.</p><img class=\"faq-illustration\" src=\"/homepage/faq-illustration.webp\" alt=\"FAQs about Eazybe\" width=\"1080\" height=\"880\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"faq-layout section-reveal-item\" style=\"--reveal-delay: 90ms;\" data-box-entrance=\"right\"><div class=\"faq\"><details name=\"eazybe-faq\" class=\"\"><summary style=\"\"><span class=\"f212-number\">01</span>Who is Eazybe?</summary><p style=\"\">Think of Eazybe as the bridge between WhatsApp and your CRM. It’s a WhatsApp CRM integration for teams that sell over chats and calls, giving managers full visibility while AI takes care of replies and follow ups.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\" class=\"\"><summary style=\"\"><span class=\"f212-number\">02</span>How does Eazybe sync WhatsApp chats?</summary><p style=\"\">Reps keep their own number and phone, and their business chats flow into a shared team inbox and your CRM through WhatsApp CRM sync. Files, voice notes and calls come along too, so the CRM fills itself in while reps get on with selling.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\" class=\"\"><summary style=\"\"><span class=\"f212-number\">03</span>Which CRMs does Eazybe support?</summary><p style=\"\">You get ready made connections for HubSpot, Salesforce, Zoho CRM, Pipedrive, Odoo, Bitrix24, LeadSquared, Freshworks and Google Sheets. Using something else? The Eazybe API and webhooks let you plug in almost any tool.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\" class=\"\"><summary style=\"\"><span class=\"f212-number\">04</span>What is WhatsApp sales intelligence in Eazybe?</summary><p style=\"\">Eazybe sales intelligence uses AI to go through your WhatsApp chats and calls, pick out details like budget, urgency and buying intent, and save them as fields in your CRM. Your team can then filter hot leads and get alerts from Eazybe when someone is ready to buy.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\" class=\"\"><summary style=\"\"><span class=\"f212-number\">05</span>What does the WhatsApp AI agent do?</summary><p style=\"\">The AI agent answers your leads on WhatsApp when your team can’t. It looks at their past chats and deal details in your CRM, asks what they need and books a call with your rep. When the lead is ready to talk, it passes the chat to the right person on your team.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\" class=\"\"><summary style=\"\"><span class=\"f212-number\">06</span>Does Eazybe track phone calls?</summary><p style=\"\">It does. Call tracking logs every call’s time, length and outcome in your CRM, working with SIM calls on Android and virtual calls. Reps can run through call lists with bulk dialling, and Voice AI can phone leads on its own, hold a real conversation, book meetings and save the transcript for your team.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\" class=\"\"><summary style=\"\"><span class=\"f212-number\">07</span>Can Eazybe send automatic follow ups?</summary><p style=\"\">Yes, CRM workflows take care of that. If a quote gets no reply in three days, for example, an automated WhatsApp follow up goes out from the rep’s own number and stops as soon as the customer writes back.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\" class=\"\"><summary style=\"\"><span class=\"f212-number\">08</span>Is the WhatsApp Business API required?</summary><p style=\"\">No, most of Eazybe works with the number you already have. The WhatsApp Cloud API only comes into play for things like large broadcasts with approved templates, and Eazybe can set it up on your existing number without touching your app or chat history.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\" class=\"\"><summary style=\"\"><span class=\"f212-number\">09</span>Is my data safe with Eazybe?</summary><p style=\"\">Eazybe only syncs the business chats you pick, so personal conversations stay personal, and access controls decide who sees what. When a rep leaves, their chats, files and call history stay with the customer record for the next rep, while they keep their own number.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\" class=\"\"><summary style=\"\"><span class=\"f212-number\">10</span>Does Eazybe offer a free trial?</summary><p style=\"\">Yes, there’s a 4 day free trial so you can test Eazybe with your own team, number and CRM. You can also book a demo and have the Eazybe team walk you through it first.</p></details></div></div></section></main>"
